"test:pkg_walk: compile:pkg_norm resolves . and .. and drops empty segments, keeping a .. it cannot resolve; compile:pkg_of reads a package.json`s name and its file: dependency as a directory beside it (a registry version names none), and takes as its readings directories the package`s own directory and then its readings directory, which a package without one does not have; compile:pkg_order places each package after its own dependencies, taken in the order its package.json lists them -- a diamond`s shared dependency once, and a dependency another one also needs straight after it -- and ends on a cycle; main:compiles takes compile-package and apps_check as compiles, so the store is not booted for either; and an app`s check writes its package`s .check.",
DEF("test:pkg_walk",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:pkg_norm"), K(A("C:/a/b/../c/./d"))), K(A("C:/a/c/d")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:pkg_norm"), K(A("../x/../../y"))), K(A("../../y")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:pkg_norm"), K(A("a//b/"))), K(A("a/b")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:pkg_of"), S4(A("CONS"), K(A("C:/r/app")), S3(A("COMP"), A("json:read"), K(A("{\"name\":\"app\",\"dependencies\":{\"lib\":\"file:../lib\",\"ext\":\"^1.0.0\"}}"))), K(S3(A("app.md"), A("package.json"), A("readings"))))), K(S4(A("app"), A("C:/r/app"), S1(S2(A("lib"), A("C:/r/lib"))), S2(A("C:/r/app"), A("C:/r/app/readings")))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:pkg_rdirs"), K(S2(A("C:/r/lib"), S2(A("lib.md"), A("package.json"))))), K(S1(A("C:/r/lib"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), A("compile:pkg_order"), K(S4(S4(A("app"), A("APP"), S2(S2(A("b"), A("B")), S2(A("c"), A("C"))), PHI()), S4(A("b"), A("B"), S1(S2(A("d"), A("D"))), PHI()), S4(A("c"), A("C"), S1(S2(A("d"), A("D"))), PHI()), S4(A("d"), A("D"), PHI(), PHI())))), K(S4(A("d"), A("b"), A("c"), A("app"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), A("compile:pkg_order"), K(S2(S4(A("x"), A("X"), S1(S2(A("y"), A("Y"))), PHI()), S4(A("y"), A("Y"), S1(S2(A("x"), A("X"))), PHI())))), K(S2(A("y"), A("x"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), A("compile:pkg_order"), K(S4(S4(A("r"), A("R"), S3(S2(A("m"), A("M")), S2(A("a"), A("A")), S2(A("o"), A("O"))), PHI()), S4(A("m"), A("M"), PHI(), PHI()), S4(A("a"), A("A"), S1(S2(A("m"), A("M"))), PHI()), S4(A("o"), A("O"), PHI(), PHI())))), K(S4(A("m"), A("a"), A("o"), A("r"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("main:compiles"), K(S2(PHI(), S3(A("compile-package"), A("o"), A("d"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("main:compiles"), K(S2(PHI(), S1(A("get"))))), K(A("F")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("main:compiles"), K(S2(PHI(), S2(A("apps_check"), A("d"))))), K(A("T")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("compile:check_out"), K(A("C:/r/app"))), K(A("C:/r/app/.check"))))))),

"test:shape_read: a carrier holds a cell`s value inside one more list than a compile`s store in memory does, and derive:sm_marks and rules:model read both alike -- the markings <<A, full>, <B, semi>> and two rules, each given wrapped and bare, answer the same; on the carrier`s shape each answers what the form it replaced answered (test:sm_marks_ref, test:rules_model_ref, which flattened once); a store without the cell has no markings and no rules; and an empty list wrapped is empty.",
