"test:text_rows holds the reflection to the sentences the schema is read from. Over a literal readings file with one derivation rule, one uniqueness sentence and one mandatory sentence, read:reflect answers ConstraintHasText for the uniqueness UC:in:WidgetHasOwner#1 and for the mandatory MC:e:WidgetHasOwner#1, each with its sentence as written, and DerivationRuleHasText and DerivationRuleProducesFactType for the rule DR:WidgetIsOwned:1, the first rule written for the derived fact type WidgetIsOwned. Before read:reflect answered these three populations the law answers F (text-rows -> F).",
