       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), A("read:firstn"), S3(A("CONS"), K(N(2)), A("test:dw_answer")), S4(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("red"))))), S4(A("COMP"), A("read:firstn"), S3(A("CONS"), K(N(2)), A("main:post_answer")), S4(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("red"))))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), N(2), A("main:post_answer"), S4(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("red"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("http:status_of"), K(A("committed"))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), N(2), A("main:post_answer"), S4(A("CONS"), A("test:dw_red"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("blue"))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("http:status_of"), K(A("refused"))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), A("read:firstn"), S3(A("CONS"), K(N(2)), A("main:post_answer")), S4(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_cover"), A("test:dw_red")), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("blue"))))), S4(A("COMP"), A("read:firstn"), S3(A("CONS"), K(N(2)), A("main:post_answer")), S4(A("CONS"), A("test:dw_red"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("blue"))))))),
       S6(A("COMP"), A("null"), A("theta:flatten"), S2(A("ALPHA"), S4(A("COND"), A("test:dw_reads"), K(S1(A("T"))), K(PHI()))), A("test:dl_checks"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), S4(A("COMP"), N(3), A("main:post_answer"), S4(A("CONS"), A("test:dw_cover"), K(A("ClubHasMotto")), K(S2(A("k1"), A("red"))))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("null"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dl_checks"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), S4(A("COMP"), N(3), A("main:post_answer"), S4(A("CONS"), A("test:dw_cover"), K(A("MemberIsJunior")), K(S1(A("m1")))))))),
       A("test:dw_stale")),
       A("test:dw_store"))),
"test:refused_render holds the answer of a write its SQL checks deny to the answer the gate in memory gives it without the cover, byte for byte: lambda renders it from the denied checks` rows (delta:refused), where the host asked the write again. Three writes over stores carrying the cover of their SQL checks: the fact POST making m1 junior over test:dw_store, which gives m1 two Grades against a uniqueness over a view; the entity POST of a Crate c3 given only a Serial, which breaks its two mandatory roles, two violations in the gate`s order; an assert giving Crate c2 the Serial c1 holds, against For each Serial, at most one Crate has that Serial; the fact POST shipping a Crate that is not checked, against a subset; and the DELETE of the fact that a Lot is open, which leaves the two Crates in it without the Status derived for a Crate in an open Lot, one mandatory over a derived fact type denied for two instances, which the gate answers in its order. Each is asked with the cover, its program run over its delta in a database with no file (test:dl_checks, test:dl_answers), and the refusal rendered from the rows of each check that answers some.",
"<rendered entry, the plan`s cover pairs> to the meta of its check as a write`s program carries it (delta:w_meta): <constraint, fact type, kind, tag word, cover key>, # for no key.",
DEF("test:rr_meta",
