    S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cs_store"), K(S3(A("Name is a value type.\nWeight is a value type.\nTag is a value type.\nSerial is a value type.\nCrate(.Name) is an entity type.\nCrate has Weight.\n  Each Crate has exactly one Weight.\nCrate has Tag.\n  Each Crate has exactly one Tag.\nCrate has Serial.\n  Each Crate has at most one Serial.\n  For each Serial, at most one Crate has that Serial.\n"),
