"<answer, answer with the names, before, run> to T when the two answer the same body and status, and, committed, no deny step answering a row, each refreshed place holding after the refresh, and the store the process holds after taking the refresh`s rows (reflect:sql_adopt) holding, what the closure without the names holds.",
DEF("test:wr_held",
    S4(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S2(A("ALPHA"), S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:seteq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(2), N(1)), S3(A("COMP"), A("system:pop_rows"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(1), N(1)), N(2)))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("distr"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:zip"), S3(A("CONS"), S5(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), N(7), N(1), N(4)), A("test:wr_qa"))), S3(A("COMP"), N(3), N(1)))))),
DEF("test:wr_adopted",
    S4(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S2(A("ALPHA"), S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:seteq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("system:pop_rows"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), S3(A("COMP"), N(1), N(2)))), S3(A("COMP"), A("system:pop_rows"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), S3(A("COMP"), N(2), N(2))))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("distr"), S3(A("CONS"), S5(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), N(7), N(1), N(4)),
          S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("reflect:sql_adopt"), S4(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(3), N(2)), S6(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), A("delta:wp_tag")), A("delta:wp_r_rows"), N(6), N(1), N(4)), A("test:wr_ra"))), S3(A("COMP"), N(3), N(1))))))),
