"test:record_violations: a decided violation a write introduces is recorded once. Over the base store with a sign-off rule decided by decide:style_signed over descriptions, adding a description signed Best, The Team records Violation:cx-rec:fx-rec with its constraint, its instance, the rule`s Text, Severity warning and the time; when the store already holds that Violation it is not recorded again, and a write that changes nothing records nothing.",
