       S3(A("COMP"), A("rmap:gate"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S4(A("LawRyFed"), PHI(), PHI(), S9(A("F"), A("F"), A("F"), A("full"), A("stored"), A("F"), A("F"), A("F"), A("F")))), A("compile:ip_cached"))))),
       A("test:ry_fx"))),
"test:sync_ruleless holds fed:sync_write to a page that carries a fully derived fact type no rule derives and no Function yields. Over test:ry_fx, a sync of a page that reads law-ry-v1 for law-ry-k1 in LawRyFed, federated at a JSON Path, and in LawRyOwn is refused, its reason names LawRyFed, and the store it answers holds no row of LawRyOwn, so nothing of the page was asserted. Such a fact type`s Table is laid as an empty view (schema:rd_empties), where a sync`s row of it would fail in SQL. Run before fed:sw_refusal, the page committed.",
