       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("check:pm3"), K(S4(S2(S2(S2(A("c1"), A("x")), S2(A("c2"), A("y"))), S2(S2(A("c1"), A("k1")), S2(A("c2"), A("k2")))), PHI(), PHI(), S1(A("c1"))))),
