"test:x_shared holds read:x_shared to the records it extends: over test:oti_text`s literal file, whose obligation builds one set comparison, read:schema and read:sc_unbuilt_rows of the records with places 9 and 10 answer what they answer of the records x_full gives, and the rule context at place 9 is read:rule_context_of`s.",
