       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:rule_context"), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:x_shared"), A("id"))), A("read:rule_context_of"))))),
       S5(A("COMP"), A("read:x_full"), A("read:x_of"), A("compile:text_rows"), A("test:oti_text")))),
"test:pop_cache holds read:pop_land`s analysis cache to the landings it saves: over a literal file of three population sentences of one reading, the parse that puts every landing`s row at once and empties its cache after every row (read:pop_flush) and the parse that keeps both answer the same declared names and, once what waits is put (read:pop_flushed), the same records, three instance records among them; the kept cache ends with one entry, so the second and the third sentence were landed from it, and the three rows wait as one group.",
