"test:part_apply holds sqlite:part_apply_sql to a table rewritten by its moved keys. A table of keys k1, k2, k3, k4 in that order; the new order k2, k1, k5, k3, k4 gone; the stage holding the moved keys` rows alone, k1 changed and k5 new. Read back in rowid order the table is k2 as it was, k1 as staged, k5 as staged, k3 as it was. Run first with the rewrite in the stage`s order and not the places`, it failed (part-apply -> F).",
