"test:schema_stored holds storage:schema_map, the statement a host opens a store through, to literal rows of the Relational Schema. In a database with no file (sqlite:scratch) the tables of the metamodel`s own map that hold the schema -- Function`s columnTableId, columnName, columnPosition, tableName, tableFactTypeId and tableKeyTableId, Column is for Role and Table Key spans Column -- hold the rows test:schema_rows holds for test:crr_store: Crate keyed by Shelf and Slot with its reference beside them, Item keyed by its Code and packed in a Crate, and Crate is inspected on Date. The statement must answer what _metaschema held for that map, table by table and position by position: the fact type each column carries, Crate`s own reference column carrying none, Item`s shelf and slot carrying Item is packed in Crate and not the identifying fact types they are also for, and Crate`s shelf its own; save, as storage:schema_map`s note says, that the position is the Column`s in its Table and a relation table`s column carries the relation. And the composed store`s map must lay out those tables with those columns, so the statement names the store`s own. Run first with storage:schema_map answering a statement that selects nothing, it failed. AND THE ROWS THE RELATIONAL SCHEMA WRITES: Crate`s reference column is for Crate belongs to Shelf`s and Crate has Slot`s first roles and still carries none, Item`s isLarge flag is for the subtype fact Large Item is a subtype of Item and carries none, and the view ItemIsListed, Table is a view, has a column that is not in the map at all; and the map lays out tableIsAView. Before the statement read those, it answered Crate`s crate as Crate belongs to Shelf, isLarge as the subtype fact and ItemIsListed`s column as ItemIsListed.",
DEF("test:ss_script",
    K(A("create table \"Function\" (\"functionId\" text primary key, \"columnTableId\" text, \"columnName\" text, \"columnPosition\" text, \"tableName\" text, \"tableFactTypeId\" text, \"tableKeyTableId\" text, \"tableIsAView\" text, \"roleFactTypeId\" text, \"roleObjectTypeId\" text, \"objectTypeObjectKind\" text); create table \"ColumnIsForRole\" (\"columnId\" text, \"roleId\" text, primary key (\"columnId\", \"roleId\")); create table \"TableKeySpansColumn\" (\"tableKeyId\" text, \"columnId\" text, primary key (\"tableKeyId\", \"columnId\")); insert into \"Function\" (\"functionId\", \"tableName\", \"tableFactTypeId\") values ('schema:Crate', 'Crate', null), ('schema:Item', 'Item', null), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate'); insert into \"Function\" (\"functionId\", \"tableKeyTableId\") values ('schema:Crate:Crate_PK', 'schema:Crate'), ('schema:Item:Item_PK', 'schema:Item'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:CrateIsInspectedOnDate_PK', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate'); insert into \"Function\" (\"functionId\", \"columnTableId\", \"columnName\", \"columnPosition\") values ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:date', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'date', '1'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:shelf', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'shelf', '2'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:slot', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'slot', '3'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:crate', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate', 'crate', '4'), ('schema:Crate:shelf', 'schema:Crate', 'shelf', '1'), ('schema:Crate:slot', 'schema:Crate', 'slot', '2'), ('schema:Crate:crate', 'schema:Crate', 'crate', '3'), ('schema:Crate:weight', 'schema:Crate', 'weight', '4'), ('schema:Item:code', 'schema:Item', 'code', '1'), ('schema:Item:crate', 'schema:Item', 'crate', '2'), ('schema:Item:shelf', 'schema:Item', 'shelf', '3'), ('schema:Item:slot', 'schema:Item', 'slot', '4'), ('schema:Item:isLarge', 'schema:Item', 'isLarge', '5'), ('schema:ItemIsListed:item', 'schema:ItemIsListed', 'item', '1'); insert into \"Function\" (\"functionId\", \"tableName\", \"tableFactTypeId\", \"tableIsAView\") values ('schema:ItemIsListed', 'ItemIsListed', 'ItemIsListed', 'T'); insert into \"ColumnIsForRole\" values ('schema:Crate:crate', 'CrateBelongsToShelf.1'), ('schema:Crate:crate', 'CrateHasSlot.1'), ('schema:Item:isLarge', 'LargeItemIsASubtypeOfItem.1'), ('schema:ItemIsListed:item', 'ItemIsListed.1'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:date', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate.2'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:shelf', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate.1'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:shelf', 'CrateBelongsToShelf.2'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:slot', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate.1'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:slot', 'CrateHasSlot.2'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:crate', 'CrateIsInspectedOnDate.1'), ('schema:Crate:shelf', 'CrateBelongsToShelf.2'), ('schema:Crate:slot', 'CrateHasSlot.2'), ('schema:Crate:weight', 'CrateHasWeight.2'), ('schema:Item:code', 'ItemHasCode.2'), ('schema:Item:crate', 'ItemIsPackedInCrate.2'), ('schema:Item:shelf', 'ItemIsPackedInCrate.2'), ('schema:Item:shelf', 'CrateBelongsToShelf.2'), ('schema:Item:slot', 'ItemIsPackedInCrate.2'), ('schema:Item:slot', 'CrateHasSlot.2'); insert into \"TableKeySpansColumn\" values ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:CrateIsInspectedOnDate_PK', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:shelf'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:CrateIsInspectedOnDate_PK', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:slot'), ('schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:CrateIsInspectedOnDate_PK', 'schema:CrateIsInspectedOnDate:date'), ('schema:Crate:Crate_PK', 'schema:Crate:shelf'), ('schema:Crate:Crate_PK', 'schema:Crate:slot'), ('schema:Item:Item_PK', 'schema:Item:code');"))),
