"A FACT OF A DERIVED FACT TYPE IS NOT POSTED OR PUT, AND THE REFUSAL SAYS WHY (a `*` or `**` derived fact type takes GET and a DELETE that retracts its source facts, and no POST or PUT). A fact POST of a `**` derived fact type answered nothing through the MCP. Over test:dft_schema, whose LawNudges is derived and stored: main:post_answer of <law-e9, law-gauge> answers refused (409) with a reason and the store it was given; main:replace_step answers the same; and the requests main:api0w routes, a POST and a PUT of the row, answer refused with a reason, where a POST answered an empty body with unknown_resource (404), LawNudges not being declared, which a client shows as no output at all.",
