       S3(A("COMP"), A("cat"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:rs_prog"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:rs_read"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("ObjectTypeInstanceIsInstanceOfObjectType")))), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:rs_read"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("ObservationIsOfFact")))))))))))),
"<program answer> to T when it committed and its last two answers are the classification and the Observation is of Fact rows the retract leaves.",
