"test:retract_sql_eq holds the program to the retract it replaces. Over test:retract_sql`s fixture, every table the write-back walks (rmap:writeback), read back after the one program lays the store out, fills it and runs the retract of test:rs_recipe, holds the rows rmap:proj_rows projects of that table from the store main:retract_entity_step answers for the same recipe in memory, table by table and as sets. Run first with retract:program answering no step, it failed.",
