    S3(A("COMP"), A("apndr"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), S4(A("CONS"), K(A("CELL")), K(A("state:store_db")), N(2))))),
"The recipes the database answers: a sel, a projection, a join, a joinon over a stored derived fact type, a minus with a source computed on read, a count, a sel of a count`s integer, a cmp, a pairwith of a text and of a number, and reads of each derived fact type computed on read -- a join`s view, a recursive view, a semi-derived merge, a functional view, a unary negation and a semi-derived relation`s.",
