"AND A GET CUTS ONLY THE PLACES THAT HOLD ITS ID. <id, served store> to T when the placed fact types get:mentioned names for the id are the ones whose cut holds it: each placed fact type with a position an entity type plays (get:typed) whose rows at its place hold the id at one of them (storage:cut_rows). Run first, before get asked which places hold an id, it failed (unresolved atom get:mentioned).",
