"A population with no place read once (orient:rows_once, what orient:rows_in answers over the cells) against the values asked one by one (orient:rows_cut): the same three rows, or-n3`s two first, in the set`s order.",
DEF("test:orient_rows_once",
    S4(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S5(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), A("orient:rows_once"), A("orient:rows_cut"))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), A("orient:rows_in"), A("orient:rows_cut"))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), N(1), N(1), A("orient:rows_once")), K(A("or-n3")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("length"), A("orient:rows_once")), K(N(3))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:oh_rows_ask"), A("test:or_store")))),
"test:or_store with or-beta contained in or-alpha, so or-alpha reaches or-beta and its scope is the two.",
DEF("test:oh_store",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("test:or_add"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:or_store"), K(S2(A("DomainIsContainedInDomain"), S1(S2(A("or-beta"), A("or-alpha")))))))),
"or-alpha`s parts, its scope read once, against the two legs each reading the scope, over a scope of two Domains.",
DEF("test:orient_scope_once",
    S4(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S3(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), A("length"), A("orient:scope"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("or-alpha")), N(2))), K(N(2)))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), A("orient:parts"),
          S3(A("CONS"),
             S3(A("COMP"), A("orient:required"), S4(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("orient:scope"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), N(2))), N(2), N(3))),
             S3(A("COMP"), A("orient:descriptions"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("orient:scope"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), N(2))), N(2))))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), S4(A("CONS"), K(A("or-alpha")), A("id"), A("orient:retired")), A("test:oh_store")))),
"<retired, cells> to orient:req_belonging over or-app`s two Domains against orient:rb2 over the same live instances.",
DEF("test:oh_rb_same",
    S3(A("COMP"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), A("orient:req_belonging"), S3(A("COMP"), A("orient:rb2"), S4(A("CONS"), N(1), N(2), A("orient:live_in"))))),
