"test:no_reference holds that an instance is identified by its id alone (core.md, Function(.id); Halpin 6.7: a subtype inherits the primary reference scheme of its root). No cell of D but test:nr_name names the retired fact type Object Type Instance has Reference, whether a DEF of lambda, its tests or its cases or a cell of the booted base, its populations and its compiled map (test:nr_cells); the base declares no such fact type; and no entity type at or under Object Type Instance in the base has a reference mode of its own (test:nr_modes). So each instance's identifying value is its Function id. It failed first over the tree that declared the fact type and Verbalization Pattern(.name).",
